OL,3,ATories pledge #10bn 'Britannia Shield'
OL,4,Aair defence system
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservatives have pledged to
OL,7,Finvest in a new missile and drone
OL,8,Fdefence system if voted into government
OL,9,Fat the next election.
OL,11,FBranding it "Britannia Shield", the
OL,12,Fparty said it would spend up to #10bn
OL,13,Fover a decade on an integrated network
OL,14,Fof radar, command and control systems,
OL,15,Fas well as interceptor missiles.
OL,17,FIn a speech to the Conservative Party
OL,18,Fconference on Tuesday, shadow defence
OL,19,Fsecretary James Cartlidge will describe
OL,20,Fit as "the most significant upgrade to
OL,21,FUK air defence for generations".
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
